title: "Fragility Score: Mapping Counterfactual Openings in Soccer Defenses"
abstract: "Structural Opening Gain (SOG) scores hypothetical player movements by their gains in attacking pitch control. Includes the implementation, derived data and analyses for reproducing the research results."
